												<li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><span style="color: #10b981; font-weight: bold;">•</span> <span style="background: #e6f4ea; color: #047857; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; display: inline-block;">Đặt lịch</span></li>
